**Angle** | Unaligned Power
__Basics__
The Angle wins when they are not lynched (but someone else is)
__Details__
When the Angle wins, the Angle ascends and stops playing. The game continues. In addition, the following lynch will be cancelled (applies to only one lynch).
The Angle may select a player. If this player is lynched, the angle will take their place allowing them to live.
The Angle may change their target once per night, with 1 emergency change to be used whenever the Angle wants to. Targetting a player is an immediate effect.
The Angle is nonaligned.

__Simplified__
The Angle wins when they steal a lynch: the game continues afterwards. In addition, the following lynch will be cancelled.
The Angle may select a player who's place they take if they are lynched

__Formalized__
